  - region:
    - text: "New"
    - heading "Recently launched" [level=2]
    - article:
      - link "View Treemap" [ref=e27]
      - heading "Treemap" [level=3]
      - text: "New Proportional tiles that morph with your data, with value and share tooltips."
    - article:
      - link "View Volume Profile" [ref=e28]
      - heading "Volume Profile" [level=3]
      - text: "New Animated volume by price, with point of control and value area highlights."
    - article:
      - link "View Status Bar" [ref=e29]
      - heading "Status Bar" [level=3]
      - text: "New Animated status history with rounded bars and period tooltips."
    - article:
      - link "View Animated Alert" [ref=e30]
      - heading "Animated Alert" [level=3]
      - text: "New Composable feedback with smooth transitions."
    - article:
      - link "View Animated Collapsible" [ref=e31]
      - heading "Animated Collapsible" [level=3]
      - text: "New Expandable content with a smooth reveal."
    - article:
      - link "View Aspect Ratio" [ref=e32]
      - heading "Aspect Ratio" [level=3]
      - text: "New Responsive media with smooth aspect ratio transitions."
    - article:
      - link "View Arc Picker" [ref=e33]
      - heading "Arc Picker" [level=3]
      - text: "New Radial text picker with top, bottom, left or right curves, smooth wheel movement and live selection on each scroll step. One persistent bracket frame grows and squeezes around each label. Supports drag momentum, keyboard input, disabled choices, controlled or uncontrolled values, forms and reduced motion."
    - article:
      - link "View Voice Orb" [ref=e34]
      - heading "Voice Orb" [level=3]
      - text: "New Breathing liquid voice visualization with flowing highlights, custom pigments and a soft, voice-reactive silhouette. Accepts a normalized level, MotionValue or caller-owned audio analyser, pauses offscreen and supports reduced motion."
    - article:
      - link "View Sortable List" [ref=e35]
      - heading "Sortable List" [level=3]
      - text: "Composable sortable list with group, item, drag handle, content and undo parts, plus a shared state hook. Spring layout, keyboard reordering, accessible position announcements, and controlled or uncontrolled items."
    - article:
      - link "View Image Viewer" [ref=e36]
      - heading "Image Viewer" [level=3]
      - text: "A composable React image viewer for galleries and attachment previews, with animated lightbox variants, custom thumbnails and controls, swipe and keyboard navigation, zoom and pan, accessible focus management, and controlled or uncontrolled selection."
    - article:
      - link "View Date Range Picker" [ref=e37]
      - heading "Date Range Picker" [level=3]
      - text: "Composable date range picker with root, trigger, popover content, calendar, header, grid, summary, footer, clear and preset parts, plus a shared state hook. Compact inline and dropdown compositions, direct month and year selection, and full keyboard navigation."
  - region:
    - text: "Components"
    - heading "Motion primitives" [level=2]
    - link "Browse animated React components" [ref=e38]
    - article:
      - link "View Button" [ref=e39]
      - heading "Button" [level=3]
      - text: "Spring-pressed Button plus StatefulButton, MagneticButton, and MetallicButton variants."
    - article:
      - link "View Morphing Modal" [ref=e40]
      - heading "Morphing Modal" [level=3]
      - text: "Family-app-style modal. A single panel that morphs its height as you navigate between inner views, with blur cross-fade on content."
    - article:
      - link "View Animated Toast Stack" [ref=e41]
      - heading "Animated Toast Stack" [level=3]
      - text: "Stacked toasts with status morphs, swipe dismissal, actions and layout-aware motion."
    - article:
      - link "View Action Swap" [ref=e42]
      - heading "Action Swap" [level=3]
      - text: "CTA button and slot primitives for swapping text and icons with blur motion."
    - article:
      - link "View Dock" [ref=e43]
      - heading "Dock" [level=3]
      - text: "macOS-style dock with grouped actions and a gliding active pill."
    - article:
      - link "View Tabs" [ref=e44]
      - heading "Tabs" [level=3]
      - text: "Pill, segment or underline tabs with a spring layoutId indicator."
    - article:
      - link "View Dynamic Island" [ref=e45]
      - heading "Dynamic Island" [level=3]
      - text: "iOS-style island pill that morphs between live activity views with bouncy shell resize and blur crossfades."
    - article:
      - link "View Command Palette" [ref=e46]
      - heading "Command Palette" [level=3]
      - text: "⌘K palette with fuzzy filter, spring-animated active row and glass surface."
    - article:
      - link "View Expandable Action Bar" [ref=e47]
      - heading "Expandable Action Bar" [level=3]
      - text: "Compact icon actions that expand into labeled controls on hover or focus with shared layout motion."
    - article:
      - link "View Expandable Tabs" [ref=e48]
      - heading "Expandable Tabs" [level=3]
      - text: "Icon tab bar where the active tab expands to a labelled pill, with a panel above that morphs height and slides content direction-aware on switch."
    - article:
      - link "View Tilt Card" [ref=e49]
      - heading "Tilt Card" [level=3]
      - text: "3D perspective tilt on hover with cursor-tracked glare."
    - article:
      - link "View Bottom Sheet" [ref=e50]
      - heading "Bottom Sheet" [level=3]
      - text: "Vaul-inspired draggable bottom sheet with snap points, inertia and glass surface."
    - article:
      - link "View Switch" [ref=e51]
      - heading "Switch" [level=3]
      - text: "Toggle with a spring-driven thumb and press feedback."
    - article:
      - link "View Tooltip" [ref=e52]
      - heading "Tooltip" [level=3]
      - text: "Hover or focus tooltip with a subtle scale and fade, collision-aware placement, and optional cursor tracking."
    - article:
      - link "View Text Animation" [ref=e53]
      - heading "Text Animation" [level=3]
      - text: "Animated text primitives for spring reveals, chromatic sweeps, shimmer loading states, letter-cascade swaps and character scrambles."
    - article:
      - link "View Number Animation" [ref=e54]
      - heading "Number Animation" [level=3]
      - text: "Animated number primitives for count-up values, rolling tickers, and fixed-slot digit swaps."
    - article:
      - link "View Bouncy Accordion" [ref=e55]
      - heading "Bouncy Accordion" [level=3]
      - text: "Single-open accordion with weighted spring layout, icon rows and reduced-motion-safe content reveals."
    - article:
      - link "View Range Slider" [ref=e56]
      - heading "Range Slider" [level=3]
      - text: "Slider with tick dots and a vertical-bar thumb that bounces as it lands on each step. Drag or keyboard, reduced-motion safe."
    - article:
      - link "View Theme Toggle" [ref=e57]
      - heading "Theme Toggle" [level=3]
      - text: "Theme toggle button that repaints the whole page through the View Transition API — a rectangle or circle clip-path reveal, or slats that open across the screen like a shutter."
    - article:
      - link "View Drawer" [ref=e58]
      - heading "Drawer" [level=3]
      - text: "Side panel that slides in from the left or right with a spring, backdrop blur, body scroll lock and esc-to-close."
    - article:
      - link "View Multi-chain Swap" [ref=e59]
      - heading "Multi-chain Swap" [level=3]
      - text: "Cross-chain swap widget with chain + token selectors, morphing views, animated flip and quote."
    - article:
      - link "View OTP Input" [ref=e60]
      - heading "OTP Input" [level=3]
      - text: "One-time-code input with a gliding focus ring, digits that roll in per slot, error shake and a success check draw."
    - article:
      - link "View Swipeable List" [ref=e61]
      - heading "Swipeable List" [level=3]
      - text: "Mobile-style list rows that swipe left or right to reveal contextual action buttons."
    - article:
      - link "View Bloom Menu" [ref=e62]
      - heading "Bloom Menu" [level=3]
      - text: "A button that morphs open into a menu and blooms iris-out from the center, the grid revealing in every direction with radially staggered items."
